1️⃣2️⃣ 🧪 تست Background Sync

DevTools → Application → Service Workers:

```
✅ Update on reload
✅ Bypass for network
✅ Offline
```

DevTools → Application → Background Services → Sync:

```
• یک tag به نام "sync-releases" ببینید
• روی "Trigger Sync" کلیک کنید
```

DevTools → Application → Background Services → Periodic Sync:

```
• tag "sync-releases-periodic" با interval 6h
```

تست دستی:

```javascript
// در کنسول:
window.APZ_BG_SYNC.fetchAndCacheReleases().then(console.log);
window.APZ_BG_SYNC.requestOneOffSync();
await window.APZ_BG_SYNC.isPeriodicEnabled();
```

